  "prefLabel": "Mec 103.04 Duties of the Board",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mec 103.04 Duties of the Board. The board shall:\n\n(a) Adopt rules as provided for in RSA 153:27 through RSA 153:36;\n\n(b) Review and approve education programs for licensure, certification, and continuing education;\n\n(c) Review and approve continuing education providers and instructors for licensing and certification programs;\n\n(d) Review and recommend adoptions, exceptions, or omissions to technical standards as adopted under RSA 153:28, III; and\n\n(e) Develop and recommend for the legislature future changes to RSA 153:27 through RSA 153:36 and these rules.\n\nSource. #10798, eff 3-18-15; (formerly Saf-Mec 103.04) (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Mec 100); #14408, eff 10-17-25",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/mec100.html"
